  <content contentuid="h605e6d4agd792g970ag9112g570fc1d4303e" version="29">Gate Stone Recaller</content>
  <content contentuid="ha8568c9cg4d63gbbd2g65b5g4d00e182ca01" version="29">When used from your inventory all Gate Stones will be moved to your inventory. Useful if a Gate Stone has become inaccessible. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This item can also be usd to summon any Gate Stones you have not found out in the world. Anyone installing this mod in Act 2 or Act 3 should activate this item and accept the popup.</content>
