  <content contentuid="hfd6d6907g9738g626fgbaacg4ea12dbbe412" version="2">(Temporary) Remove Duplicate Stones</content>
  <content contentuid="ha0888639g52eegb50ag6917gb34713a3fe45" version="2">Activate</content>
  <content contentuid="h03de657bg6280g6e64ge6f8g89df89b8aa91" version="2">This is a one use item. This item will only appear for those updating from 1.0 to 1.1. In 1.1 I changed how the Gate Stones were given to the player. Due to this, people who already had the mod installed would receive a duplicate version of each Gate Stone. This item will resolve that when consumed.</content>
  <content contentuid="h7c9cf96bg3178g9a60g09dfg1fa4400607c8" version="2">Gate Stone Duplicate Disintegrator</content>
  <content contentuid="h76da10d0g53aeg1d2cg7b31g879d43a5484c" version="2">This unusually shaped crest bears the markings of a Lathanderian high priest, but its practical function is unclear. </content>
  <content contentuid="hd8043928g8b53g4fb1g62b9g7a5498980aae" version="1">%%% EMPTY</content>
  <content contentuid="h3bd55655g4364g961bg3631g82c9f9ba8b6f" version="3">Gate Stone Duplicate Disintegrator</content>
  <content contentuid="h5f960606g1014g4e76g1fdbg52f4f7f02574" version="3">This is a one time use item. It will remove duplicate Gate Stones caused by updating from 1.0 to 1.1.</content>
  <content contentuid="h3d3eb75fg64c4gdc1bgc373g878eccb898a6" version="1">%%% EMPTY</content>
  <content contentuid="h7a88e9deg1fa6gb2a4gb14bg4b90434cfab7" version="5">Gate Stone Duplicate Disabler</content>
  <content contentuid="h21df936bg3899g7216g5cbeg95fffa8b82f1" version="5" />
  <content contentuid="hef2f2c79g225fg7bb0g5362gf5d70fc51a48" version="2">This item is a one time use fix for those updating from 1.0. You should collect all your Gate Stones and then use this item in your inventory. It will disable the duplicate stones from being used for teleporting and clean up some DB entries. Once this is consumed, just throw all your stones on the ground and use the recaller to get the working ones.</content>
  <content contentuid="h2ec05ce3g33d7g6376g3a8fg73742044358b" version="1">Activate</content>
  <content contentuid="ha512d7b9gcbf5g5b72gc9c3gad08dd01a5e7" version="1">&lt;b&gt;WARNING!&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Updating Gate Stones from 1.X to 2.0 is unsupported. Please reload and downgrade.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Failure to do so will result in problems with the mod and your save.</content>
  <content contentuid="h195366a4g3564gc06cg4db3g0fc0792b529f" version="1">It appears you have not found 1 or more Gate Stones, would you like to summon all Gate Stones that you have not found?&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you are in Act 2 or Act 3 you should accept this as it will be impossible for you to get the Gate Stones any other way.</content>
